nd.io/api/mc/badges/confidence/npm/svelte/5.39.12/5.55.3?slim=true)\n|\n\n---\n\n### Release Notes\n\n<details>\n<summary>sveltejs/svelte (svelte)</summary>\n\n###\n[`v5.55.3`](https://redirect.github.com/sveltejs/svelte/blob/HEAD/packages/svelte/CHANGELOG.md#5553)\n\n[Compare\nSource](https://redirect.github.com/sveltejs/svelte/compare/svelte@5.55.2...svelte@5.55.3)\n\n##### Patch Changes\n\n- fix: ensure proper HMR updates for dynamic components\n([#&#8203;18079](https://redirect.github.com/sveltejs/svelte/pull/18079))\n\n- fix: correctly calculate `@const` blockers\n([#&#8203;18039](https://redirect.github.com/sveltejs/svelte/pull/18039))\n\n- fix: freeze deriveds once their containing effects are destroyed\n([#&#8203;17921](https://redirect.github.com/sveltejs/svelte/pull/17921))\n\n- fix: defer error boundary rendering in forks\n([#&#8203;18076](https://redirect.github.com/sveltejs/svelte/pull/18076))\n\n- fix: avoid false positives for reactivity loss warning\n([#&#8203;18088](https://redirect.github.com/sveltejs/svelte/pull/18088))\n\n###\n[`v5.55.2`](https://redirect.github.com/sveltejs/svelte/blob/HEAD/packages/svelte/CHANGELOG.md#5552)\n\n[Compare\nSource](https://redirect.github.com/sveltejs/svelte/compare/svelte@5.55.1...svelte@5.55.2)\n\n##### Patch Changes\n\n- fix: invalidate `@const` tags based on visible references in legacy\nmode\n([#&#8203;18041](https://redirect.github.com/sveltejs/svelte/pull/18041))\n\n- fix: handle parens in template expressions more robustly\n([#&#8203;18075](https://redirect.github.com/sveltejs/svelte/pull/18075))\n\n- fix: disallow `--` in `idPrefix`\n([#&#8203;18038](https://redirect.github.com/sveltejs/svelte/pull/18038))\n\n- fix: correct types for `ontoggle` on `<details>` elements\n([#&#8203;18063](https://redirect.github.com/sveltejs/svelte/pull/18063))\n\n- fix: don''t override `$destroy/set/on` instance methods in dev mode\n([#&#8203;18034](https://redirect.github.com/sveltejs/svelte/pull/18034))\n\n- fix: unskip branches of earlier batches after commit\n([#&#8203;18048](https://redirect.github.com/sveltejs/svelte/pull/18048))\n\n- fix: never set derived.v inside fork\n([#&#8203;18037](https://redirect.github.com/sveltejs/svelte/pull/18037))\n\n- fix: skip rebase logic in non-async mode\n([#&#8203;18040](https://redirect.github.com/sveltejs/svelte/pull/18040))\n\n- fix: don''t reset status of uninitialized deriveds\n([#&#8203;18054](https://redirect.github.com/sveltejs/svelte/pull/18054))\n\n###\n[`v5.55.1`](https://redirect.github.com/sveltejs/svelte/blob/HEAD/packages/svelte/CHANGELOG.md#5551)\n\n[Compare\nSource](https://redirect.github.com/sveltejs/svelte/compare/svelte@5.55.0...svelte@5.55.1)\n\n##### Patch Changes\n\n- fix: correctly handle bindings on the server\n([#&#8203;18009](https://redirect.github.com/sveltejs/svelte/pull/18009))\n\n- fix: prevent hydration error on async `{@&#8203;html ...}`\n([#&#8203;17999](https://redirect.github.com/sveltejs/svelte/pull/17999))\n\n- fix: cleanup `superTypeParameters` in\n`ClassDeclarations`/`ClassExpression`\n([#&#8203;18015](https://redirect.github.com/sveltejs/svelte/pull/18015))\n\n- fix: improve duplicate module import error message\n([#&#8203;18016](https://redirect.github.com/sveltejs/svelte/pull/18016))\n\n- fix: reschedule new effects in prior batches\n([#&#8203;18021](https://redirect.github.com/sveltejs/svelte/pull/18021))\n\n###\n[`v5.55.0`](https://redirect.github.com/sveltejs/svelte/blob/HEAD/packages/svelte/CHANGELOG.md#5550)\n\n[Compare\nSource](https://redirect.github.com/sveltejs/svelte/compare/svelte@5.54.1...svelte@5.55.0)\n\n##### Minor Changes\n\n- feat: export TweenOptions, SpringOptions, SpringUpdateOptions and\nUpdater from svelte/motion\n([#&#8203;17967](https://redirect.github.com/sveltejs/svelte/pull/17967))\n\n##### Patch Changes\n\n- fix: ensure HMR wrapper forwards correct start/end nodes to active\neffect\n([#&#8203;17985](https://redirect.github.com/sveltejs/svelte/pull/17985))\n\n###\n[`v5.54.1`](https://redirect.github.com/sveltejs/svelte/blob/HEAD/packages/svelte/CHANGELOG.md#5541)\n\n[Compare\nSource](https://redirect.github.com/sveltejs/svelte/compare/svelte@5.54.0...svelte@5.54.1)\n\n##### Patch Changes\n\n- fix: hydration comments during hmr\n([#&#8203;17975](https://redirect.github.com/sveltejs/svelte/pull/17975))\n\n- fix: null out `effect.b` in `destroy_effect`\n([#&#8203;17980](https://redirect.github.com/sveltejs/svelte/pull/17980))\n\n- fix: group sync statements\n([#&#8203;17977](https://redirect.github.com/sveltejs/svelte/pull/17977))\n\n- fix: defer batch resolution until earlier intersecting batches have\ncommitted\n([#&#8203;17162](https://redirect.github.com/sveltejs/svelte/pull/17162))\n\n- fix: properly invoke `iterator.return()` during reactivity loss check\n([#&#8203;17966](https://redirect.github.com/sveltejs/svelte/pull/17966))\n\n- fix: remove trailing semicolon from\n{[@&#8203;const](https://redirect.github.com/const)} tag printer\n([#&#8203;17962](https://redirect.github.com/sveltejs/svelte/pull/17962))\n\n###\n[`v5.54.0`](https://redirect.github.com/sveltejs/svelte/blob/HEAD/packages/svelte/CHANGELOG.md#5540)\n\n[Compare\nSource](https://redirect.github.com/sveltejs/svelte/compare/svelte@5.53.13...svelte@5.54.0)\n\n##### Minor Changes\n\n- feat: allow `css`, `runes`, `customElement` compiler options to be\nfunctions\n([#&#8203;17951](https://redirect.github.com/sveltejs/svelte/pull/17951))\n\n##### Patch Changes\n\n- fix: reinstate reactivity loss tracking\n([#&#8203;17801](https://redirect.github.com/sveltejs/svelte/pull/17801))\n\n###\n[`v5.53.13`](https://redirect.github.com/sveltejs/svelte/blob/HEAD/packages/svelte/CHANGELOG.md#55313)\n\n[Compare\nSource](https://redirect.github.com/sveltejs/svelte/compare/svelte@5.53.12...svelte@5.53.13)\n\n##### Patch Changes\n\n- fix: ensure `$inspect` after top level await doesn''t break builds\n([#&#8203;17943](https://redirect.github.com/sveltejs/svelte/pull/17943))\n\n- fix: resume inert effects when they come from offscreen\n([#&#8203;17942](https://redirect.github.com/sveltejs/svelte/pull/17942))\n\n- fix: don''t eagerly access not-yet-initialized functions in template\n([#&#8203;17938](https://redirect.github.com/sveltejs/svelte/pull/17938))\n\n- fix: discard batches made obsolete by commit\n([#&#8203;17934](https://redirect.github.com/sveltejs/svelte/pull/17934))\n\n- fix: ensure \"is standalone child\" is correctly reset\n([#&#8203;17944](https://redirect.github.com/sveltejs/svelte/pull/17944))\n\n- fix: remove nodes in boundary when work is pending and HMR is active\n([#&#8203;17932](https://redirect.github.com/sveltejs/svelte/pull/17932))\n\n###\n[`v5.53.12`](https://redirect.github.com/sveltejs/svelte/blob/HEAD/packages/svelte/CHANGELOG.md#55312)\n\n[Compare\nSource](https://redirect.github.com/sveltejs/svelte/compare/svelte@5.53.11...svelte@5.53.12)\n\n##### Patch Changes\n\n- fix: update `select.__value` on `change`\n([#&#8203;17745](https://redirect.github.com/sveltejs/svelte/pull/17745))\n\n- chore: add `invariant` helper for debugging\n([#&#8203;17929](https://redirect.github.com/sveltejs/svelte/pull/17929))\n\n- fix: ensure deriveds values are correct across batches\n([#&#8203;17917](https://redirect.github.com/sveltejs/svelte/pull/17917))\n\n- fix: handle async RHS in `assignment_value_stale`\n([#&#8203;17925](https://redirect.github.com/sveltejs/svelte/pull/17925))\n\n- fix: avoid traversing clean roots\n([#&#8203;17928](https://redirect.github.com/sveltejs/svelte/pull/17928))\n\n###\n[`v5.53.11`](https://redirect.github.com/sveltejs/svelte/blob/HEAD/packages/svelte/CHANGELOG.md#55311)\n\n[Compare\nSource](https://redirect.github.com/sveltejs/svelte/compare/svelte@5.53.10...svelte@5.53.11)\n\n##### Patch Changes\n\n- fix: remove `untrack` circular dependency\n([#&#8203;17910](https://redirect.github.com/sveltejs/svelte/pull/17910))\n\n- fix: recover from errors that leave a corrupted effect tree\n([#&#8203;17888](https://redire