tp://www.sitemaps.org/schemas/sitemap/0.9/sitemap.xsd\"''\n    ]\n  }\n});\n```\n\n##### Testing\n\n- ✅ All existing tests passing\n- ✅ 8 new tests added covering positive and security scenarios\n- ✅ 100% backward compatible with 8.0.1\n\n##### Files Changed\n\n2 files changed: 144 insertions, 5 deletions\n\n###\n[`v8.0.1`](https://redirect.github.com/ekalinin/sitemap.js/blob/HEAD/CHANGELOG.md#801---Security-Patch-Release)\n\n[Compare\nSource](https://redirect.github.com/ekalinin/sitemap.js/compare/8.0.0...8.0.1)\n\n**SECURITY FIXES** - This release backports comprehensive security\npatches from 9.0.0 to 8.0.x\n\n##### Security Improvements\n\n- **XML Injection Prevention**: Enhanced XML entity escaping, added `>`\ncharacter escaping, attribute name validation\n- **Parser Security**: Added resource limits (max 50K URLs, 1K images,\n100 videos per sitemap), string length limits, URL validation\n(http/https only, max 2048 chars)\n- **Protocol Injection Prevention**: Block dangerous protocols\n(javascript:, data:, file:, ftp:) in sitemap index parser\n- **DoS Protection**: Memory exhaustion protection, URL length\nvalidation, date format validation (ISO 8601)\n- **Path Traversal Prevention**: Block `..` sequences in file paths\n- **Command Injection Fix**: xmllint now uses stdin exclusively instead\nof file paths\n- **Input Validation**: Comprehensive validation for all user inputs -\nnumbers (reject NaN/Infinity), dates (check Invalid Date), URLs, paths\n- **XSS Prevention**: XSL URL validation to prevent script injection\n- **Namespace Security**: Custom namespace validation (max 20, max 512\nchars each)\n\n##### Infrastructure\n\n- Added `lib/constants.ts` - Centralized security limits and constants\n- Added `lib/validation.ts` - Comprehensive validation functions\n- Added new security-related error classes\n\n##### Backward Compatibility\n\n- ✅ **100% API compatible** with 8.0.0\n- Added `XMLToSitemapItemStream.error` getter for backward compatibility\n(returns `errors[0]`)\n- All existing valid inputs continue to work\n- Only rejects invalid/malicious inputs\n- Default `ErrorLevel.WARN` behavior unchanged\n\n##### Dependencies Updated\n\n- `sax`: ^1.2.4 → ^1.4.1 (security updates)\n\n##### Files Changed\n\n17 files changed: 2,122 additions, 245 deletions\n\n##### Testing\n\n- All 94 existing tests passing\n- No breaking changes to public API\n\n</details>\n\n---\n\n### Configuration\n\n📅 **Schedule**: Branch creation - At any time (no schedule defined),\nAutomerge - At any time (no schedule defined).\n\n🚦 **Automerge**: Enabled.\n\n♻ **Rebasing**: Whenever PR is behind base branch, or you tick the\nrebase/retry checkbox.\n\n🔕 **Ignore**: Close this PR and you won''t be reminded about this update\nagain.\n\n---\n\n- [ ] <!-- rebase-check -->If you want to rebase/retry this PR, check\nthis box\n\n---\n\nThis PR was generated by [Mend Renovate](https://mend.io/renovate/).\nView the [repository job\nlog](https://developer.mend.io/github/runtime-env/import-meta-env).\n\n<!--renovate-debug:eyJjcmVhdGVkSW5WZXIiOiI0Mi4xOS45IiwidXBkYXRlZEluVmVyIjoiNDIuMTkuOSIsInRhcmdldEJyYW5jaCI6Im1haW4iLCJsYWJlbHMiOltdfQ==-->\n\nCo-authored-by: renovate[bot] <29139614+renovate[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJpLcnLCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAHVIQADW/O3aABPDvWy0fYT6ZTDbX\n75+ifbvcqDhQjGmoPzho8fx/zxte9m0EDP1VMctSJlTrNO4n8XkD/x6QhEWFE42w\n3pN3tEp6vvqIhiXjQDgXFfEoyL96ziSR+wJB0UOVr8aL0p35xedI7cwkKOxzNgrB\n2OKRKNF6iiLsZ4L13M4pq6VRHns8sFVGwrExFzDSnOSYGcVchGp+kyiGuOdDOSAe\nLdOz86wyVPYcMbpxVkb14kq44Rn+d1the3ZH6oXhmETsQ/y62xT9m1ythWTc68on\nodTFRgAzDtTfNyVq7A7oNq5SgI9M9zX5lb3dUz48qowUCpMH+EjmZTpyrbdYFnZO\nM5tS/n6EWskXhDNysePTmqLGiJ5G+g6gPHz+6jxtAYSkZpBU+5WT7Elt74DrHZpT\nkUNoyj14nAu/r//ABUSke2ktQc0yjts1pxnBuosb8FD8UK94XLmsgbHH5aTXv4oB\nA9eqpLflSG0g+lDU87x3lMQbZMMy+31XeIhDCkJbsmRzAH+eOCZkn7Yid3oWVho0\nliZQ1br8flIhOuL5K+6ZgbPMaXuTqgAa2sRS//oBRQL4NAX59p/ejysfm6fWgyEu\nxiJg6/8f4cfly4FDKWHT8LOXSlMEAbXK