n) in\n[#&#8203;542](https://redirect.github.com/unjs/unplugin/issues/542)\n[<samp>(36518)</samp>](https://redirect.github.com/unjs/unplugin/commit/365188e)\n\n#####    🐞 Bug Fixes\n\n- **rspack**: Remove virtual plugin cleanup signal handlers  -  by\n[@&#8203;elbywan](https://redirect.github.com/elbywan) in\n[#&#8203;541](https://redirect.github.com/unjs/unplugin/issues/541)\n[<samp>(ca420)</samp>](https://redirect.github.com/unjs/unplugin/commit/ca42080)\n\n#####     [View changes on\nGitHub](https://redirect.github.com/unjs/unplugin/compare/v2.3.8...v2.3.9)\n\n###\n[`v2.3.8`](https://redirect.github.com/unjs/unplugin/releases/tag/v2.3.8)\n\n[Compare\nSource](https://redirect.github.com/unjs/unplugin/compare/v2.3.7...v2.3.8)\n\n#####    🐞 Bug Fixes\n\n- **rspack**: Gate virtual folder behind process pid  -  by\n[@&#8203;elbywan](https://redirect.github.com/elbywan) in\n[#&#8203;538](https://redirect.github.com/unjs/unplugin/issues/538)\n[<samp>(417a6)</samp>](https://redirect.github.com/unjs/unplugin/commit/417a6bf)\n\n#####     [View changes on\nGitHub](https://redirect.github.com/unjs/unplugin/compare/v2.3.7...v2.3.8)\n\n###\n[`v2.3.7`](https://redirect.github.com/unjs/unplugin/releases/tag/v2.3.7)\n\n[Compare\nSource](https://redirect.github.com/unjs/unplugin/compare/v2.3.6...v2.3.7)\n\n#####    🐞 Bug Fixes\n\n- **rspack**: Prevents an unhandled promise rejection when throwing in\nthe async loader  -  by\n[@&#8203;elbywan](https://redirect.github.com/elbywan) in\n[#&#8203;536](https://redirect.github.com/unjs/unplugin/issues/536)\n[<samp>(cfbc2)</samp>](https://redirect.github.com/unjs/unplugin/commit/cfbc208)\n\n#####     [View changes on\nGitHub](https://redirect.github.com/unjs/unplugin/compare/v2.3.6...v2.3.7)\n\n###\n[`v2.3.6`](https://redirect.github.com/unjs/unplugin/releases/tag/v2.3.6)\n\n[Compare\nSource](https://redirect.github.com/unjs/unplugin/compare/v2.3.5...v2.3.6)\n\n#####    🐞 Bug Fixes\n\n- Exact optional property types  -  by\n[@&#8203;iwoplaza](https://redirect.github.com/iwoplaza) in\n[#&#8203;500](https://redirect.github.com/unjs/unplugin/issues/500)\n[<samp>(97f20)</samp>](https://redirect.github.com/unjs/unplugin/commit/97f2036)\n\n#####     [View changes on\nGitHub](https://redirect.github.com/unjs/unplugin/compare/v2.3.5...v2.3.6)\n\n###\n[`v2.3.5`](https://redirect.github.com/unjs/unplugin/releases/tag/v2.3.5)\n\n[Compare\nSource](https://redirect.github.com/unjs/unplugin/compare/v2.3.4...v2.3.5)\n\n#####    🐞 Bug Fixes\n\n- **rspack**: Prevent vfs concurrency issues for parallel builds  -  by\n[@&#8203;elbywan](https://redirect.github.com/elbywan) in\n[#&#8203;510](https://redirect.github.com/unjs/unplugin/issues/510)\n[<samp>(43e58)</samp>](https://redirect.github.com/unjs/unplugin/commit/43e5893)\n\n#####     [View changes on\nGitHub](https://redirect.github.com/unjs/unplugin/compare/v2.3.4...v2.3.5)\n\n###\n[`v2.3.4`](https://redirect.github.com/unjs/unplugin/releases/tag/v2.3.4)\n\n[Compare\nSource](https://redirect.github.com/unjs/unplugin/compare/v2.3.3...v2.3.4)\n\n#####    🐞 Bug Fixes\n\n- Rollback webpack \\_\\_vfsModules to use a Set  -  by\n[@&#8203;elbywan](https://redirect.github.com/elbywan) in\n[#&#8203;507](https://redirect.github.com/unjs/unplugin/issues/507)\n[<samp>(25b52)</samp>](https://redirect.github.com/unjs/unplugin/commit/25b5205)\n\n#####     [View changes on\nGitHub](https://redirect.github.com/unjs/unplugin/compare/v2.3.3...v2.3.4)\n\n###\n[`v2.3.3`](https://redirect.github.com/unjs/unplugin/releases/tag/v2.3.3)\n\n[Compare\nSource](https://redirect.github.com/unjs/unplugin/compare/v2.3.2...v2.3.3)\n\n#####    🐞 Bug Fixes\n\n- **rspack**: Prevent vfs concurrency issues  -  by\n[@&#8203;elbywan](https://redirect.github.com/elbywan) in\n[#&#8203;504](https://redirect.github.com/unjs/unplugin/issues/504)\n[<samp>(9f680)</samp>](https://redirect.github.com/unjs/unplugin/commit/9f68016)\n\n#####     [View changes on\nGitHub](https://redirect.github.com/unjs/unplugin/com