\n|\n\n---\n\n### Release Notes\n\n<details>\n<summary>preactjs/preact (preact)</summary>\n\n###\n[`v10.27.2`](https://redirect.github.com/preactjs/preact/releases/tag/10.27.2)\n\n[Compare\nSource](https://redirect.github.com/preactjs/preact/compare/10.27.1...10.27.2)\n\n#### Types\n\n- Mirror non-JSX types to the ''preact'' namespace\n([#&#8203;4904](https://redirect.github.com/preactjs/preact/issues/4904),\nthanks [@&#8203;rschristian](https://redirect.github.com/rschristian))\n\n#### Fixes\n\n- Address memory leak\n([#&#8203;4906](https://redirect.github.com/preactjs/preact/issues/4906),\nthanks [@&#8203;JoviDeCroock](https://redirect.github.com/JoviDeCroock))\n\n###\n[`v10.27.1`](https://redirect.github.com/preactjs/preact/releases/tag/10.27.1)\n\n[Compare\nSource](https://redirect.github.com/preactjs/preact/compare/10.27.0...10.27.1)\n\n#### Performance\n\n- Avoid re-inserting children during bailout\n([#&#8203;4890](https://redirect.github.com/preactjs/preact/issues/4890),\nthanks [@&#8203;vasylenkoval](https://redirect.github.com/vasylenkoval))\n\n#### Types\n\n- add missing React.Key\n([#&#8203;4864](https://redirect.github.com/preactjs/preact/issues/4864),\nthanks [@&#8203;shyguy1412](https://redirect.github.com/shyguy1412))\n- make React.SVGAttributes generic\n([#&#8203;4863](https://redirect.github.com/preactjs/preact/issues/4863),\nthanks [@&#8203;shyguy1412](https://redirect.github.com/shyguy1412))\n\n#### Fixes\n\n- Add `.render` property referencing original render function\n([#&#8203;4870](https://redirect.github.com/preactjs/preact/issues/4870),\nthanks [@&#8203;upupming](https://redirect.github.com/upupming))\n- Add `.type` property referencing original component\n([#&#8203;4869](https://redirect.github.com/preactjs/preact/issues/4869),\nthanks [@&#8203;upupming](https://redirect.github.com/upupming))\n\n#### Maintenance\n\n- Fix benchmarks for v10.x\n([#&#8203;4891](https://redirect.github.com/preactjs/preact/issues/4891),\nthanks [@&#8203;rschristian](https://redirect.github.com/rschristian))\n- Correct contributing docs\n([#&#8203;4861](https://redirect.github.com/preactjs/preact/issues/4861),\nthanks [@&#8203;JoviDeCroock](https://redirect.github.com/JoviDeCroock))\n\n###\n[`v10.27.0`](https://redirect.github.com/preactjs/preact/releases/tag/10.27.0)\n\n[Compare\nSource](https://redirect.github.com/preactjs/preact/compare/10.26.9...10.27.0)\n\n#### Features\n\n- Update `refcallback` type to reflect possibility of returning cleanup\nfunction and add debug helper exports\n([#&#8203;4860](https://redirect.github.com/preactjs/preact/issues/4860),\nthanks [@&#8203;rschristian](https://redirect.github.com/rschristian))\n- Backport of\n[#&#8203;4830](https://redirect.github.com/preactjs/preact/pull/4830)\nand\n[#&#8203;4801](https://redirect.github.com/preactjs/preact/pull/4801)\n\n#### Fixes\n\n- Ensure we rerender after a suspensefully hydrating boundary throws an…\n([#&#8203;4856](https://redirect.github.com/preactjs/preact/issues/4856),\nthanks [@&#8203;JoviDeCroock](https://redirect.github.com/JoviDeCroock))\n\n#### Maintenance\n\n- Update ''replaceNode'' deprecation comment to point at new shim\n([#&#8203;4844](https://redirect.github.com/preactjs/preact/issues/4844),\nthanks [@&#8203;rschristian](https://redirect.github.com/rschristian))\n- Reduce some repeated logic\n([#&#8203;4814](https://redirect.github.com/preactjs/preact/issues/4814))\n([#&#8203;4821](https://redirect.github.com/preactjs/preact/issues/4821),\nthanks [@&#8203;JoviDeCroock](https://redirect.github.com/JoviDeCroock))\n\n###\n[`v10.26.9`](https://redirect.github.com/preactjs/preact/releases/tag/10.26.9)\n\n[Compare\nSource](https://redirect.github.com/preactjs/preact/compare/10.26.8...10.26.9)\n\n#### Fixes\n\n- Export `test-utils` from compat by\n[@&#8203;rawrmonstar](https://redirect.github.com/rawrmonstar) in\n[#&#8203;4783](https://redirect.github.com/preactjs/preact/pull/4783)\n- Escape `style` object value in `precompile` transform by\n[@&#8203;marvinhagemeister](https://redirect.github.com/marvinhagemeister)\nin [#&#8203;4795](https://redirect.github.com/preactjs/preact/pull/4795)\n- Fix signal attribute values not working with `precompile` transform by\n[@&#8203;marvinhagemeister](https://redirect.github.com/marvinhagemeister)\nin [#&#8203;4798](https://redirect.github.com/preactjs/preact/pull/4798)\n\n#### Maintenance\n\n- Bump `browserslist` by\n[@&#8203;rschristian](https://redirect.github.com/rschristian) in\n[#&#8203;4785](https://redirect.github.com/preactjs/preact/pull/4785)\n- Avoid caching so file-saves work first try by\n[@&#8203;JoviDeCroock](https://redirect.github.com/JoviDeCroock) in\n[#&#8203;4786](https://redirect.github.com/preactjs/preact/pull/4786)\n- Make previous benchmark results not required by\n[@&#8203;marvinhagemeister](https://redirect.github.com/marvinhagemeister)\nin [#&#8203;4796](https://redirect.github.com/preactjs/preact/pull/4796)\n- Point release workflow to 10.x by\n[@&#8203;marvinhagemeister](https://redirect.github.com/marvinhagemeister)\nin [#&#8203;4797](https://redirect.github.com/preactjs/preact/pull/4797)\n\n</details>\n\n---\n\n### Configuration\n\n📅 **Schedule**: Branch creation - At any time (no schedule defined),\nAutomerge - At any time (no schedule defined).\n\n🚦 **Automerge**: Enabled.\n\n♻ **Rebasing**: Whenever PR is behind base branch, or you tick the\nrebase/retry checkbox.\n\n🔕 **Ignore**: Close this PR and you won''t be reminded about this update\nagain.\n\n---\n\n- [ ] <!-- rebase-check -->If you want to rebase/retry this PR, check\nthis box\n\n---\n\nThis PR was generated by [Mend Renovate](https://mend.io/renovate/).\nView the [repository job\nlog](https://developer.mend.io/github/runtime-env/import-meta-env).\n\n<!--renovate-debug:eyJjcmVhdGVkSW5WZXIiOiI0MS4xNDMuMSIsInVwZGF0ZWRJblZlciI6IjQxLjE0My4xIiwidGFyZ2V0QnJhbmNoIjoibWFpbiIsImxhYmVscyI6W119-->\n\nCo-authored-by: renovate[bot] <29139614+renovate[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>"