ived_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/renovate%5Bbot%5D/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/renovate%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/renovate%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/renovate%5Bbot%5D","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/runtime-env/import-meta-env/commits/ff4e2fd61854d90e8e3e9af7e4087918860bc932/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-10-06T05:54:44Z","email":"29139614+renovate[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"renovate[bot]"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-10-06T05:54:44Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"chore(deps): update dependency chai to v5.3.3 (#2190)\n\n> [!NOTE]\n> Mend has cancelled [the proposed\nrenaming](https://redirect.github.com/renovatebot/renovate/discussions/37842)\nof the Renovate GitHub app being renamed to `mend[bot]`.\n> \n> This notice will be removed on 2025-10-07.\n\n<hr>\n\nThis PR contains the following updates:\n\n| Package | Change | Age | Confidence |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| [chai](http://chaijs.com)\n([source](https://redirect.github.com/chaijs/chai)) | [`5.2.0` ->\n`5.3.3`](https://renovatebot.com/diffs/npm/chai/5.2.0/5.3.3) |\n[![age](https://developer.mend.io/api/mc/badges/age/npm/chai/5.3.3?slim=true)](https://docs.renovatebot.com/merge-confidence/)\n|\n[![confidence](https://developer.mend.io/api/mc/badges/confidence/npm/chai/5.2.0/5.3.3?slim=true)](https://docs.renovatebot.com/merge-confidence/)\n|\n\n---\n\n### Release Notes\n\n<details>\n<summary>chaijs/chai (chai)</summary>\n\n###\n[`v5.3.3`](https://redirect.github.com/chaijs/chai/releases/tag/v5.3.3)\n\n[Compare\nSource](https://redirect.github.com/chaijs/chai/compare/v5.3.2...v5.3.3)\n\n#### What''s Changed\n\n- fix: keep names in bundle by\n[@&#8203;43081j](https://redirect.github.com/43081j) in\n[#&#8203;1702](https://redirect.github.com/chaijs/chai/pull/1702)\n- chore: support publishing v5 by\n[@&#8203;43081j](https://redirect.github.com/43081j) in\n[#&#8203;1703](https://redirect.github.com/chaijs/chai/pull/1703)\n- chore: update npm tag name by\n[@&#8203;43081j](https://redirect.github.com/43081j) in\n[#&#8203;1704](https://redirect.github.com/chaijs/chai/pull/1704)\n\n**Full Changelog**:\n<https://github.com/chaijs/chai/compare/v5.3.2...v5.3.3>\n\n###\n[`v5.3.2`](https://redirect.github.com/chaijs/chai/releases/tag/v5.3.2)\n\n[Compare\nSource](https://redirect.github.com/chaijs/chai/compare/v5.3.1...v5.3.2)\n\nReverts the removal of the bundled version of chai in 5.3.1\n\n#### What''s Changed\n\n- Update core contributors by\n[@&#8203;keithamus](https://redirect.github.com/keithamus) in\n[#&#8203;1697](https://redirect.github.com/chaijs/chai/pull/1697)\n- feat: reintroduce bundle by\n[@&#8203;43081j](https://redirect.github.com/43081j) in\n[#&#8203;1699](https://redirect.github.com/chaijs/chai/pull/1699)\n\n**Full Changelog**:\n<https://github.com/chaijs/chai/compare/v5.3.1...v5.3.2>\n\n###\n[`v5.3.1`](https://redirect.github.com/chaijs/chai/releases/tag/v5.3.1)\n\n[Compare\nSource](https://redirect.github.com/chaijs/chai/compare/v5.3.0...v5.3.1)\n\n#### What''s Changed\n\n- chore: remove bundled chai by\n[@&#8203;43081j](https://redirect.github.com/43081j) in\n[#&#8203;1694](https://redirect.github.com/chaijs/chai/pull/1694)\n\n**Full Changelog**:\n<https://github.com/chaijs/chai/compare/v5.3.0...v5.3.1>\n\n###\n[`v5.3.0`](https://redirect.github.com/chaijs/chai/releases/tag/v5.3.0)\n\n[Compare\nSource](https://redirect.github.com/chaijs/chai/compare/v5.2.2...v5.3.0)\n\n#### What''s Changed\n\n- chore: change `main` to point at chai directly by\n[@&#8203;43081j](https://redirect.github.com/43081j) in\n[#&#8203;1696](https://redirect.github.com/chaijs/chai/pull/1696)\n\n**Full Changelog**:\n<https://github.com/chaijs/chai/compare/v5.2.2...v5.3.0>\n\n###\n[`v5.2.2`](https://redirect.github.com/chaijs/chai/releases/tag/v5.2.2)\n\n[Compare\nSource](https://redirect.github.com/chaijs/chai/compare/v5.2.1...v5.2.2)\n\n#### What''s Changed\n\n- chore: use `files` for publishing by\n[@&#8203;43081j](https://redirect.github.com/43081j) in\n[#&#8203;1695](https://redirect.github.com/chaijs/chai/pull/1695)\n\n**Full Changelog**:\n<https://github.com/chaijs/chai/compare/v5.2.1...v5.2.2>\n\n###\n[`v5.2.1`](https://redirect.github.com/chaijs/chai/releases/tag/v5.2.1)\n\n[Compare\nSource](https://redirect.github.com/chaijs/chai/compare/v5.2.0...v5.2.1)\n\n#### What''s Changed\n\nMostly internal changes but\n[@&#8203;SuperchupuDev](https://redirect.github.com/SuperchupuDev)\nrealised the package.json `engines` field was out of date, so it has\nbeen updated to reflect that v5.0.0 onwards only supports Node >=18.\n\n- build(deps): bump serialize-javascript and mocha by\n[@&#8203;dependabot](https://redirect.github.com/dependabot) in\n[#&#8203;1673](https://redirect.github.com/chaijs/chai/pull/1673)\n- build(deps-dev): bump esbuild from 0.19.10 to 0.25.0 by\n[@&#8203;dependabot](https://redirect.github.com/dependabot) in\n[#&#8203;1671](https://redirect.github.com/chaijs/chai/pull/1671)\n- Enable `no-var` rule and fix violations by\n[@&#8203;koddsson](https://redirect.github.com/koddsson) in\n[#&#8203;1675](https://redirect.github.com/chaijs/chai/pull/1675)\n- Convert Assertion function to a class by\n[@&#8203;koddsson](https://redirect.github.com/koddsson) in\n[#&#8203;1677](https://redirect.github.com/chaijs/chai/pull/1677)\n- More typing by\n[@&#8203;koddsson](https://redirect.github.com/koddsson) in\n[#&#8203;1679](https://redirect.github.com/chaijs/chai/pull/1679)\n- build(deps-dev): bump tar-fs from 3.0.6 to 3.0.8 by\n[@&#8203;dependabot](https://redirect.github.com/dependabot) in\n[#&#8203;1682](https://redirect.github.com/chaijs/chai/pull/1682)\n- build(deps-dev): bump tar-fs from 3.0.8 to 3.0.9 by\n[@&#8203;dependabot](https://redirect.github.com/dependabot) in\n[#&#8203;1688](https://redirect.github.com/chaijs/chai/pull/1688)\n- chore: fix lint errors and add lint to CI by\n[@&#8203;43081j](https://redirect.github.com/43081j) in\n[#&#8203;1689](https://redirect.github.com/chaijs/chai/pull/1689)\n- docs: update minimum node version in readme by\n[@&#8203;SuperchupuDev](https://redirect.github.com/SuperchupuDev) in\n[#&#8203;1691](https://redirect.github.com/chaijs/chai/pull/1691)\n- chore: update minimum node version by\n[@&#8203;SuperchupuDev](https://redirect.github.com/SuperchupuDev) in\n[#&#8203;1692](https://redirect.github.com/chaijs/chai/pull/1692)\n\n#### New Contributors\n\n- [@&#8203;SuperchupuDev](https://redirect.github.com/SuperchupuDev)\nmade their first contribution in\n[#&#8203;1691](https://redirect.github.com/chaijs/chai/pull/1691)\n\n**Full Changelog**:\n<https://github.com/chaijs/chai/compare/v5.2.0...v5.2.1>\n\n</details>\n\n---\n\n### Configuration\n\n📅 **Schedule**: Branch creation - At any time (no schedule defined),\nAutomerge - At any time (no schedule defined).\n\n🚦 **Automerge**: Enabled.\n\n♻ **Rebasing**: Whenever PR is behind base branch, or you tick the\nrebase/retry checkbox.\n\n🔕 **Ignore**: Close this PR and you won''t be reminded about this update\nagain.\n\n---\n\n- [ ] <!-- rebase-check -->If you want to rebase/retry this PR, check\nthis box\n\n---\n\nThis PR was generated by [Mend Renovate](https://mend.io/renovate/).\nView the [repository job\nlog](https://developer.mend.io/github/runtime-env/import-meta-env).\n\n<!--renovate-debug:eyJjcmVhdGVkSW5WZXIiOiI0MS4xMzEuOSIsInVwZGF0ZWRJblZlciI6IjQxLjEzMS45IiwidGFyZ2V0QnJhbmNoIjoibWFpbiIsImxhYmVscyI6W119-->\n\nCo-authored-by: renovate[bot] <29139614+renovate[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"12b3f2e9ec78ccd0a4ba0ac2ee3762dea0eca96f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/runtime-env/import-meta-env/git/trees/12b3f2e9ec78ccd0a4ba0ac2ee3762dea0eca96f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/runtime-env/import-meta-env/git/commits/ff4e2fd61854d9