ction build/deploy tooling and Netlify config\n\nAdds build-all.sh/serve-all.sh/stop-all.sh to build all 6 apps and\nconsolidate the 5 microfrontend bundles into root-config''s own dist/mfe/,\nproducing a single self-contained deploy package. root-config.ts now\nresolves microfrontend script URLs per environment (localhost ports in\ndev, same-origin /mfe/<name>/ paths in production); Angular''s production\nbuild gets a matching /mfe/angular/ deployUrl so its lazy chunks resolve\ncorrectly. netlify.toml wires build-all.sh + the consolidated dist/ folder\nup for Netlify''s Git-based deploys.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"5c9dbd920dca8de169c6ea7b7e2a96d9dcb21742","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RecepSivri/rs-data-grid/git/trees/5c9dbd920dca8de169c6ea7b7e2a96d9dcb21742"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RecepSivri/rs-data-grid/git/commits/963917432ba345a99b7c71f5f5712b8a8a9b1176","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16796421?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RecepSivri/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RecepSivri/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RecepSivri/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RecepSivri/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/RecepSivri","id":16796421,"login":"RecepSivri","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2Nzk2NDIx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RecepSivri/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RecepSivri/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RecepSivri/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RecepSivri/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RecepSivri/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RecepSivri","user_view