Q6VXNlcjg1MDk3MzE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denniskigen/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denniskigen/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denniskigen/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denniskigen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denniskigen/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/denniskigen","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openmrs/openmrs-esm-admin-tools/commits/c727d81885a0c131c4780971a28243de9854998b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-07T12:38:15Z","email":"kigen.work@gmail.com","name":"Dennis Kigen"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T12:38:15Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"(fix) Pin the report overlay''s action buttons to the bottom (#419)\n\nThe run-report and edit-scheduled-report forms set\n`justify-content: space-between` on a column that had no height to fill,\nso the Cancel and Run buttons sat directly under the last input, and the\ninputs spread apart as the form grew.\n\nMake the overlay a flex column, let the form fill it, and push the button\nset to the bottom with `margin-top: auto` so the inputs stay top-aligned.","tree":{"sha":"d8aa1e9ebb1220dcd9079d0b5993025110385862","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openmrs/openmrs-esm-admin-tools/git/trees/d8aa1e9ebb1220dcd9079d0b5993025110385862"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openmrs/openmrs-esm-admin-tools/git/commits/c727d81885a0c131c4780971a28243de9854998b","verification":{"payload":"tree d8aa1e9ebb1220dcd9079d0b5993025110385862\nparent e15756bc945c6d9ca573b507532ea7d02153d870\nauthor Dennis Kigen <kigen.work@gmail.com> 1791376695 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791376695 +0000\n\n(fix) Pin the report overlay''s action buttons to the bottom (#419)\n\nThe run-report and edit-scheduled-report forms set\n`justify-content: s