tent.com/u/8509731?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denniskigen/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denniskigen/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denniskigen/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denniskigen/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/denniskigen","id":8509731,"login":"denniskigen","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg1MDk3MzE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denniskigen/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denniskigen/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denniskigen/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denniskigen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denniskigen/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/denniskigen","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openmrs/openmrs-esm-admin-tools/commits/06a5b092b1cd90a40745932a80b20866ab0bec12/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-02T20:39:28Z","email":"kigen.work@gmail.com","name":"Dennis Kigen"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-02T20:39:28Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"(fix) Add page headers to the other Reports pages (#414)\n\n* (fix) Add page headers to the other Reports pages\n\nGive the Scheduled reports and Reports data overview pages the same\nPageHeader and ReportsPictogram as the Reports overview, so all three\nReports pages share one header.\n\nEach page now renders the full-width header followed by its content in\nthe overview''s .content wrapper. This replaces the bare h3 inside a\n130px white panel that the table and filter form overflowed, and the\nempty 48px spacer on the Scheduled reports page. The now-unused .page,\n.mainPanelDiv and .reportsLabelDiv rules are removed.\n\nThe Scheduled reports title''s default text drops the \"Scheduld\" typo.\nThe data overview test mocks the header and checks that it renders.\n\n* Test the Scheduled reports page header\n\nThe Scheduled reports page had no test, so nothing checked its new header. Add one that renders the page and checks for the heading, the pictogram and a scheduled report row.","tree":{"sha":"45e9e584138772ed528f0739ac63f8362829b677","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openmrs/openmrs-esm-admin-tools/git/trees/45e9e584138772ed528f0739ac63f8362829b677"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openmrs/openmrs-esm-admin-tools/git/commits/06a5b092b1cd90a40745932a80b20866ab0bec12","verification":{"payload":"tree 45e9e584138772ed528f0739ac63f8362829b677\nparent 0e8bbe0a4b6401d45f0c7da3f26b2d3848508ef1\nauthor Dennis Kigen <kigen.work@gmail.com> 1790973568 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790973568 +0300\n\n(fix) Add page headers to the other Reports pages (#414)\n\n* (fix) Add page headers to the other Reports pages\n\nGive the Scheduled reports and Reports data overview pages the same\nPageHeader and ReportsPictogram as the Reports overview, so all three\nReports pages share one header.\n\nEach page now renders the full-width header followed by its content in\nthe overview''s .content wrapper. This replaces the bare h3 inside a\n130px white panel that the table and filter form overflowed, and the\nempty 48px spacer on the Scheduled reports page. The now-unused .page,\n.mainPanelDiv and .reportsLabelDiv rules are removed.\n\nThe Scheduled reports title''s default text drops the \"Scheduld\" typo.\nThe data overview test mocks the header and checks that it renders.\n\n* Test the Scheduled reports page header\n\nThe Scheduled reports page had no test, so nothing checked its new header. Add one that renders the page and checks for the heading, the pictogram and a scheduled report row.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqwBaACRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAARqAQAH7kZiYnyYkGRv1WYRleUCPx\nMuIkFzdYlQCK/XFmw98YpX1OmlKQK5ne0jED0F3VxMoVckh2MX4th0f