pi.github.com/users/denniskigen/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denniskigen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denniskigen/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/denniskigen","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openmrs/openmrs-esm-admin-tools/commits/feb0ba00e3382e0c55e4b3615648217d7d619198/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-01T19:20:05Z","email":"kigen.work@gmail.com","name":"Dennis Kigen"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-01T19:20:05Z","email":"kigen.work@gmail.com","name":"Dennis Kigen"},"message":"(chore) Remove unused stylesheet classes from the reports app\n\nDelete 13 CSS Module classes in esm-reports-app that no component\nreferences. Each stylesheet is a CSS Module, so a class only applies\nwhen a file that imports that stylesheet uses it as styles.<name>, and\nnone of these are:\n\n- root.scss: welcome, explainer (plus the @carbon/type import, which\n  only welcome used)\n- components/reports.scss: emptyButton, breadcrumbsSlot\n- components/overlay.scss: closeButton, overlayContent (the desktop and\n  tablet breakpoint blocks contained only overlayContent)\n- components/run-report/run-report-form.scss: parameterElement,\n  cancelActionButton, tableIcon, rowCellEven, rowCellOdd\n- components/edit-scheduled-report/edit-scheduled-report-form.scss:\n  reportButton\n- components/simple-cron-editor/simple-cron-editor.scss: cronEditor\n\nrowCellEven, rowCellOdd and reportButton are still in use, but from\nother stylesheets: the overview tables use the copies in reports.scss,\nand the run report form uses the copy in run-report-form.scss. Only the\nunreferenced duplicates are removed.","tree":{"sha":"38b1afa0fe53fc1160a7c8861c3242b925d966ae","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openmrs/openmrs-esm-admin-tools/git/trees/38b1afa0fe53fc1160a7c8861c3242b925d966ae"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openmrs