/denniskigen/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denniskigen/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denniskigen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denniskigen/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/denniskigen","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openmrs/openmrs-esm-admin-tools/commits/e7b618c8853787677ac28a20580d588eb2b1c6c0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-28T22:55:37Z","email":"kigen.work@gmail.com","name":"Dennis Kigen"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-28T22:55:37Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"(fix) Declare react-dom as a peer dependency (#391)\n\nAdd react-dom 18.x to peerDependencies in the metadata export and reports apps.\n\nThe app shell provides react-dom through module federation, but the\nOpenMRS rspack config only shares the dependencies an app lists in\npeerDependencies. Without react-dom listed there, the app loads the\ncopy of react-dom bundled into its own build instead of the shell''s.","tree":{"sha":"89ce0c9bd13c8b60a5ef57f0186872bba7d58a36","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openmrs/openmrs-esm-admin-tools/git/trees/89ce0c9bd13c8b60a5ef57f0186872bba7d58a36"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openmrs/openmrs-esm-admin-tools/git/commits/e7b618c8853787677ac28a20580d588eb2b1c6c0","verification":{"payload":"tree 89ce0c9bd13c8b60a5ef57f0186872bba7d58a36\nparent 0650119730a5eb0bc35f02f514cdfd0f0204165a\nauthor Dennis Kigen <kigen.work@gmail.com> 1790636137 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790636137 -0400\n\n(fix) Declare react-dom as a peer dependency (#391)\n\nAdd react-dom 18.x to peerDependencies in the metadata export and reports apps.\n\nThe app shell provides react-dom through module federation, but the\nOpenMRS rspack config only shares the dependencies an app lists in\npeerDependencies. Without react-dom listed there, the