ting payment_date_format_template CMS string.\n\nCo-authored-by: Håkon Harnes <hakon.harnes@effektiv-spenden.org>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqv79HCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAELIQAJx5tVKh9DVhaJO3yU3+s9VV\nL1VKE1shPBuSgOplrN3yVXml1DYVdlX3KUBPC7Q88D/oAy09W28uWPg1bNn2W2i9\n6o8pXZy2A2sc+RMBIrIri3GPOuWw3iJ1R3DtxWnPG5AQxWAOhVy4fYMJikB2SE3t\nVWDVAMu81xYnEik6MSE9PgvEstdPUq519+DiI6wgkQ1f+Wz6ozPmLKZArH3hymAb\nFiViq9zKzrO8VyGLS8kQtkmOeL/cG3aGZIfqnmrSDIRJToZz7QdtqfoftxXsk6Ti\nVSPyMWk8lrYU+dVc0ARs7SIoGgdfJtvv8kOPOSjZk176mtK/mQBj9RY29bw7/pY8\nKkleQb2IjOsRKgy+quls8QV3jDMrTYL9Dpnj7fK699BjCGNDpdzq91Tv0NNjnvuF\nMHxC4jfA0+p/Re4N6L2QoxjeuNQPXYlH01OP39U36gEKtVUUd53d0De2Ti4B2wRz\nZMYH+ZWHCovM88lLhTy2OLK6G+pUa7LllEPdMNys4gHu1gdK3Igp8/6RnTmX+3Gr\nFLja7+lCz5dKVxBgb4kQtz+kvvug65h0pCI5D+6OGxbbYS6+10GE5H5mDFNXnnnO\nAc/YSKmRkfE7fy4L/ASJh98YAr/RqjszJv3yYq+ADgWTHDAqEhD8+MetQ0Blhekg\nDfW5NC6Ol1gClC7Cv3yb\n=NX9+\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-02T14:27:19Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/stiftelsen-effekt/main-site/commit/33313cdb7a0f706c0789506e58cd15da9c81f647","node_id":"C_kwDOGueVwtoAKDMzMzEzY2RiN2EwZjcwNmMwNzg5NTA2ZTU4Y2QxNWRhOWM4MWY2NDc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/stiftelsen-effekt/main-site/commit/7578531a7693212bdc9dacca4bebbcdc4fe181e3","sha":"7578531a7693212bdc9dacca4bebbcdc4fe181e3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stiftelsen-effekt/main-site/commits/7578531a7693212bdc9dacca4bebbcdc4fe181e3"}],"sha":"33313cdb7a0f706c0789506e58cd15da9c81f647","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stiftelsen-effekt/main-site/commits/33313cdb7a0f706c0789506e58cd15da9c81f647"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/693641?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fellmirr/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fellmirr/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fellmirr/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fellmirr/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fellmirr","id":693641,"login":"fellmirr","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY5MzY0MQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fellmirr/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fellmirr/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fellmirr/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fellmirr/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fellmirr/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fellmirr","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stiftelsen-effekt/main-site/commits/7578531a7693212bdc9dacca4bebbcdc4fe181e3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-02T14:19:45Z","email":"account@harnes.me","name":"Håkon Harnes"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-02T14:19:45Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Remove the fundraiser leaderboard chart block (#1179)\n\n* Remove the fundraiser leaderboard chart block\n\nThe chart read sums from GET /fundraisers/donationsums, which the backend\nremoved in March 2025 when fundraisers moved off Adoveo. Since then the\nrequest falls through to /fundraisers/:id (\"Invalid ID\") and the chart\nthrows \"Cannot read properties of undefined (reading ''map'')\". Its only use\nis the NO fundraisers-leaderboard page; a native leaderboard will replace it.\n\nThe generated studio/sanity.types.ts and schema.json still contain the\nunused Fundraiserchart type; regenerating them on Sanity 6 is a separate\nchange.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Fix the studio typegen script for Sanity 6 and dotenv-cli 11\n\nSanity 6 refuses to overwrite schema.json without --force, and without\n`--` dotenv-cli 11 takes --force as its own flag instead of passing it on.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Håkon Harnes <hakon.harnes@effektiv-spenden.org>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"7483e151a0a3097445fd8a561eaaeed069d91afc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stiftelsen-effekt/main-site/git/trees/7483e151a0a3097445fd8a561eaaeed069d91afc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stiftelsen-effekt/main-site/git/commits/7578531a7693212bdc9dacca4bebbcdc4fe181e3","verification":{"payload":"tree 7483e151a0a3097445fd8a561eaaeed069d91afc\nparent fb241de5b3ef507c5e0a4d2590b9c4a087c031f9\nauthor Håkon Harnes <account@harnes.me> 1790950785 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790950785 +0200\n\nRemove the fundraiser leaderboard chart block (#1179)\n\n* Remove the fundraiser leaderboard chart block\n\nThe chart read sums from GET /fundraisers/donationsums, which the backend\nremoved in March 2025 when fundraisers moved off Adoveo. Since then the\nrequest falls through to /fundraisers/:id (\"Invalid ID\") and the chart\nthrows \"Cannot read properties of undefined (reading ''map'')\". Its only use\nis the NO fundraisers-leaderboard page; a native leaderboard will replace it.\n\nThe generated studio/sanity.types.ts and schema.json still contain the\nunused Fundraiserchart type; regenerating them on Sanity 6 is a separate\nchange.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Fix the studio typegen script for Sanity 6 and dotenv-cli 11\n\nSanity 6 refuses to overwrite schema.json without --force, and without\n`--` dotenv-cli 11 takes --force as its own flag instead of passing it on.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Håkon Harnes <hakon.harnes@effektiv-spenden.org>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqv72BCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA6h8QADhJAL5LihS91YBmgcRLDC/K\n77JOJXGdaGutdt1kL2nl+koDUwAaluTb7OLvxOQ1C0B+t2MZQ3pXy0+EyjeYX5Xz\nA3yzs7pXxPUFgHYti39XztCRNJkCdYclqIGPGD4gjFPcYkqoHpJ4z8TTrwRtkmcS\nfd9SZwSwtoyMy7qvozbn2zjHGu1JXIKWvDkiapl0VR7jkGgrppDFUyxGbociWG8d\nmtMMuwC5W6n9HB5pHG4TJ8mBAX2fcieLuCxPR1sTpZRTIcKAmOUJS4q7FrvKTrY6\nHqSVW3SOvC4wWFXBm8sV4VTKcKfm1cxQv/uvj4kBZIej4C+mrniHwf212BN6LzuW\n9NBmBOPDXZ8hHTzwe9qJf9loH7f/q3mYTbUG2JPu4zafjDwDGcFvElXy6bVWTyx3\nPS3/XETbB2F3RHCVVE0Qc7i99nGVbbVtXDmS94KmMetpS/Jlq4AgTlKp8K5EeINO\ncTjFDW4sLO15A3Jbi78cAMGrAHG4Y7wRbAnllJdmPPHiVpsFBdEM4/gHBSlwXwHr\nNlRPi8cWAvDgbKEnDPBVB2urW4beP4tyGy2SsmI2mWGqYp/enUeHDWVIoMllh5eN\ndfIJcMgYlsQtR5FjAMekxk/Qh/uxnO8ZsKH0y4sehmZn/of6mgUppT5w5tJaJm1d\ngHW1KsD6tSjdAwQ8vQIY\n=aAJP\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-02T14:19:45Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/oth