github.com/users/fellmirr/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fellmirr/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fellmirr/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fellmirr/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fellmirr","id":693641,"login":"fellmirr","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY5MzY0MQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fellmirr/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fellmirr/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fellmirr/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fellmirr/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fellmirr/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fellmirr","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stiftelsen-effekt/main-site/commits/35f10423e631c85cb18039e857fd6db9aaa2a440/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-02T12:45:56Z","email":"account@harnes.me","name":"Håkon Harnes"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-02T12:45:56Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Upgrade next-plausible to 4 (Plausible script v2) (#1176)\n\nv4 replaces the `domain` prop with each site''s script URL from the\nPlausible dashboard. The three URLs live in lib/plausible.ts, keyed by\nNEXT_PUBLIC_PLAUSIBLE_DOMAIN so no new env vars are needed; an unknown\ndomain fails the build instead of reporting to the wrong site.\n\n- Keep v3''s proxy paths (/js/script.js, /proxy/api/event), which the\n  middleware already skips, instead of v4''s default /api/event.\n- Drop trackOutboundLinks/taggedEvents/revenue: script v2 includes them\n  and they are toggled per site in the Plausible dashboard.\n- Transpile next-plausible: it reads the proxy paths from `env` values\n  that are only inlined into compiled code, so as an external module it\n  threw \"src is required\" while prerendering.\n\nCo-authored-by: Håkon Harnes <hakon.harnes@effektiv-spenden.org>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ea00d29fb592a1684e99eeefc3de358b36ec25da","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stiftelsen-effekt/main-site/git/trees/ea00d29fb592a1684e99eeefc3de358b36ec25da"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stiftelsen-effekt/main-site/git/commits/35f10423e631c85cb18039e857fd6db9aaa2a440","verification":{"payload":"tree ea00d29fb592a1684e99eeefc3de358b36ec25da\nparent 492b186595834ef5d1c1f7f36322aecb1e2d56e3\nauthor Håkon Harnes <account@harnes.me> 1790945156 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790945156 +0200\n\nUpgrade next-plausible to 4 (Plausible script v2) (#1176)\n\nv4 replaces the `domain` prop with each site''s script URL from the\nPlausible dashboard. The three URLs live in lib/plausible.ts, keyed by\nNEXT_PUBLIC_PLAUSIBLE_DOMAIN so no new env vars are needed; an unknown\ndomain fails the build instead of reporting to the wrong site.\n\n- Keep v3''s proxy paths (/js/script.js, /proxy/api/event), which the\n  middleware already skips, instead of v4''s default /api/event.\n- Drop trackOutboundLinks/taggedEvents/revenue: script v2 includes them\n  and they are toggled per site in the Plausible dashboard.\n- Transpile next-plausible: it reads the proxy paths from `env` values\n  that are only inlined into compiled code, so as an external module it\n  threw \"src is required\" while prerendering.\n\nCo-authored-by: Håkon Harnes <hakon.harnes@effektiv-spenden.org>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqv6eECRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAxMAQACGSJkGroqe5QnA8mjnzt3Qd\n4m80xLVTjmZ58bkBqegL/H4i7/LWvSuRsj3cPt2qmqDn1Lgqz+uEDtFMgaOGUTbN\nv5yhGDlZwR0rv6h6bqWvGcQwdh4eW16akTVDjn6YhlDHJRltsQGiG1YagmcXzDH6\nTP5cWq0dI+9hkQwPWB+/EKyFQjeQ1+8iKkROMY7S4pGwqQ7pxwNwHqt+4+AGyME2\ntbShNBCGj5c05IWcmUNJtMvZU0ozVmXApbvyP5DmFpeTJmV1D15x1vAcIshbFK6e\nDl