thub.com/repos/stiftelsen-effekt/main-site/commits/35f10423e631c85cb18039e857fd6db9aaa2a440"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/693641?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fellmirr/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fellmirr/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fellmirr/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fellmirr/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fellmirr","id":693641,"login":"fellmirr","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY5MzY0MQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fellmirr/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fellmirr/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fellmirr/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fellmirr/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fellmirr/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fellmirr","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stiftelsen-effekt/main-site/commits/492b186595834ef5d1c1f7f36322aecb1e2d56e3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-02T12:20:43Z","email":"account@harnes.me","name":"Håkon Harnes"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-02T12:20:43Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Upgrade next-seo to 7 and cookies-next to 6; remove unused packages (#1170)\n\n* Bump dependencies within their current semver ranges\n\nRun `npm update --save` and `npm audit fix` in the root and studio.\nRoot advisories drop from 51 to 13 and studio from 46 to 12, clearing\nboth criticals (tar and decompress in the Sanity CLI). Everything left\nneeds a major bump.\n\n- Transpile next-sanity: 12.4 imports \"next/dynamic\" without an\n  extension, which fails when loaded as an external ESM module.\n- Keep @auth0/auth0-react on 2.10: 2.25+ types getAccessTokenSilently\n  as possibly undefined, which needs code changes (separate PR).\n- Pin the @types/react override to the direct dependency''s range.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Upgrade next-seo from 5.15 to 7.3\n\nnext-seo v7 is a rewrite: the Pages Router <NextSeo> component is replaced\nby generateNextSeo() from \"next-seo/pages\", whose output is rendered inside\nnext/head ourselves. Our only usage is the shared SEO component, so it now\nwraps generateNextSeo() in <Head> with the same title template, description,\ncanonical, Open Graph, Twitter and additional meta tags. og:site_name is now\npassed as openGraph.siteName (site_name is still accepted but siteName is the\nv7 name). The rendered <head> tags are unchanged.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Upgrade cookies-next from 4.3 to 6.1\n\ncookies-next v5+ splits the API into \"cookies-next/client\" and\n\"cookies-next/server\" entry points for Next 15+. The cookie banner only sets\nthe consent cookie from a click handler in the browser, so it now imports\nsetCookie from \"cookies-next/client\", which keeps the server-side\n(next/headers) implementation out of the client bundle. Client setCookie is\nstill synchronous and serializes with the same defaults (path \"/\", strings\nwritten as-is), so the gieffektivt-cookies-accepted cookie keeps the same\nname, \"true\"/\"false\" value, path, SameSite=Lax and 365 day expiry that the\nmiddleware reads.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Remove unused jwt-decode dependency\n\njwt-decode was listed in dependencies but nothing in the app, studio or\nCypress code imports it (auth tokens are handled by @auth0/auth0-react),\nso instead of migrating to the v4 named jwtDecode export it is removed.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Remove unused @redux-devtools/extension dependency\n\n@redux-devtools/extension (composeWithDevTools/devToolsEnhancer) is not\nimported anywhere; the widget store is created with Redux Toolkit, whose\nconfigureStore enables the Redux DevTools extension on its own. It is\nremoved instead of being bumped from 3 to 4.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Håkon Harnes <hakon.harnes@effektiv-spenden.org>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"21a36bb333114bd24e87da6ecea5c614eb2ea5dd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stiftelsen-effekt/main-site/git/trees/21a36bb333114bd24e87da6ecea5c614eb2ea5dd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stiftelsen-effekt/main-site/git/commits/492b186595834ef5d1c1f7f36322aecb1e2d56e3","verification":{"payload":"tree 21a36bb333114bd24e87da6ecea5c614eb2ea5dd\nparent 0b7bd8dce346543f38abda1f93c41364a0271249\nauthor Håkon Harnes <account@harnes.me> 1790943643 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790943643 +0200\n\nUpgrade next-seo to 7 and cookies-next to 6; remove unused packages (#1170)\n\n* Bump dependencies within their current semver ranges\n\nRun `npm update --save` and `npm audit fix` in the root and studio.\nRoot advisories drop from 51 to 13 and studio from 46 to 12, clearing\nboth criticals (tar and decompress in the Sanity CLI). Everything left\nneeds a major bump.\n\n- Transpile next-sanity: 12.4 imports \"next/dynamic\" without an\n  extension, which fails when loaded as an external ESM module.\n- Keep @auth0/auth0-react on 2.10: 2.25+ types getAccessTokenSilently\n  as possibly undefined, which needs code changes (separate PR).\n- Pin the @types/react override to the direct dependency''s range.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Upgrade next-seo from 5.15 to 7.3\n\nnext-seo v7 is a rewrite: the Pages Router <NextSeo> component is replaced\nby generateNextSeo() from \"next-seo/pages\", whose output is rendered inside\nnext/head ourselves. Our only usage is the shared SEO component, so it now\nwraps generateNextSeo() in <Head> with the same title template, description,\ncanonical, Open Graph, Twitter and additional meta tags. og:site_name is now\npassed as openGraph.siteName (site_name is still accepted but siteName is the\nv7 name). The rendered <head> tags are unchanged.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Upgrade cookies-next from 4.3 to 6.1\n\ncookies-next v5+ splits the API into \"cookies-next/client\" and\n\"cookies-next/server\" entry points for Next 15+. The cookie banner only sets\nthe consent cookie from a click handler in the browser, so it now imports\nsetCookie from \"cookies-next/client\", which keeps the server-side\n(next/headers) implementation out of the client bundle. Client setCookie is\nstill synchronous and serializes with the same defaults (path \"/\", strings\nwritten as-is), so the gieffektivt-cookies-accepted cookie keeps the same\nname, \"true\"/\"false\" value, path, SameSite=Lax and 365 day expiry that the\nmiddleware reads.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Remove unused jwt-decode dependency\n\njwt-decode was listed in dependencies but nothing in the app, studio or\nCypress code imports it (auth tokens are handled by @auth0/auth0-react),\nso instead of migrating to the v4 named jwtDecode export it is removed.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Remove unused @redux-devtools/extension dependency\n\n@redux-devtools/extension (composeWithDevTools/devToolsEnhancer) is not\nimported anywhere; the widget store is created with Redux Toolkit, whose\nconfigureStore enables the Redux DevTools extension on its own. It is\nremoved instead of being bumped from 3 to 4.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Håkon Harnes <hakon.harnes@effektiv-spenden.org>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"--