DU2ZTM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/stiftelsen-effekt/main-site/commit/0b7bd8dce346543f38abda1f93c41364a0271249","sha":"0b7bd8dce346543f38abda1f93c41364a0271249","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stiftelsen-effekt/main-site/commits/0b7bd8dce346543f38abda1f93c41364a0271249"}],"sha":"492b186595834ef5d1c1f7f36322aecb1e2d56e3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stiftelsen-effekt/main-site/commits/492b186595834ef5d1c1f7f36322aecb1e2d56e3"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/693641?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fellmirr/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fellmirr/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fellmirr/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fellmirr/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fellmirr","id":693641,"login":"fellmirr","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY5MzY0MQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fellmirr/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fellmirr/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fellmirr/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fellmirr/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fellmirr/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fellmirr","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stiftelsen-effekt/main-site/commits/0b7bd8dce346543f38abda1f93c41364a0271249/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-02T12:09:15Z","email":"account@harnes.me","name":"Håkon Harnes"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-02T12:09:15Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Upgrade dev tooling: Prettier 3, husky 9, lint-staged 16, dotenv-cli 11, @types/node 22 (#1172)\n\n* Bump dependencies within their current semver ranges\n\nRun `npm update --save` and `npm audit fix` in the root and studio.\nRoot advisories drop from 51 to 13 and studio from 46 to 12, clearing\nboth criticals (tar and decompress in the Sanity CLI). Everything left\nneeds a major bump.\n\n- Transpile next-sanity: 12.4 imports \"next/dynamic\" without an\n  extension, which fails when loaded as an external ESM module.\n- Keep @auth0/auth0-react on 2.10: 2.25+ types getAccessTokenSilently\n  as possibly undefined, which needs code changes (separate PR).\n- Pin the @types/react override to the direct dependency''s range.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Upgrade prettier 2.8.1 -> 3.9.9 without reformatting the codebase\n\nThe repo''s .prettierrc already sets trailingComma \"all\", arrowParens\n\"always\" and printWidth 100, so Prettier 3''s changed defaults do not\naffect us and no option pinning is needed. Prettier 3 also respects\n.gitignore by default, which only drops already-ignored files (e.g.\n.claude/) from the check.\n\nPrettier 3 does change some formatting algorithms that have no option\nto revert (nested ternary indentation, multi-value CSS `transition`\ndeclarations broken onto lines, single-line union types, parens around\n`??` inside ternaries, hugging of curried function arguments). 39\nexisting files would be reformatted by `prettier --write`. They are\nintentionally left untouched here to avoid conflicting with other open\nPRs; lint-staged will reformat them incrementally when touched, or a\none-off `npm run format` can be done once the parallel PRs have landed.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Upgrade husky 8 -> 9 and lint-staged 13 -> 16\n\nhusky 9: `prepare` is now just `husky` (`husky install` is deprecated),\nand hook files no longer need the shebang and `husky.sh` sourcing line.\nhusky now generates its own .husky/_ (with its own .gitignore), so the\nold .husky/.gitignore is removed.\n\nlint-staged 16 (Node >= 20.17) clears the npm audit advisories for\nlint-staged, micromatch and yaml pulled in by lint-staged 13. Our config\nis a plain glob -> \"prettier --write\" mapping and is unaffected by the\n14/15/16 breaking changes (Node versions, removed --shell flag, execa ->\nnano-spawn). lint-staged 17 requires Node >= 22.22.1, so we stay on 16.\n\nAfter pulling this, run `npm install` once so husky points\ncore.hooksPath at .husky/_.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Upgrade cross-env 7 -> 10, dotenv-cli 7 -> 11, dotenv 16 -> 17\n\ncross-env 10 is an ESM-only rewrite requiring Node >= 20; the CLI usage\nin our cypress scripts (`cross-env VAR=value cmd`) is unchanged.\n\ndotenv-cli 8-11 changed variable expansion (now dotenv-expand 12) and is\nquiet by default. Comparing the environment produced by\n`dotenv -e .env.sanity.build` and `dotenv -e .env.local` under 7.4.4 and\n11.0.0 gives identical values for every key from the env files; only\npre-existing shell variables that contain `$` are no longer re-expanded,\nwhich is the intended upstream change. `npm run prebuild` (Sanity Studio\nbuild) still succeeds.\n\ndotenv is held at 17 rather than 18: dotenv 18 ships its own `dotenv`\nbin (`dotenv run -f ...`), which collides with dotenv-cli''s `dotenv` bin\nin node_modules/.bin. With dotenv 18 installed, `dotenv -e file -- cmd`\nresolved to dotenv''s CLI and failed, breaking prebuild and the sanity\nscripts. Root dotenv is only needed as the peer dependency of\ncypress-dotenv, which uses the unchanged `config()` API.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Upgrade csv-parse 5 -> 7\n\nFixes the npm audit advisory for csv-parse < 7.0.2 (prototype\nreplacement reachable via `columns`). csv-parse is only used by the\nWealthCalculator data script (`npm run generate:wealthmountain`), which\nuses `parse` from `csv-parse/sync` with `columns: true`; that API is\nunchanged. Running the script before and after the upgrade produces a\nbyte-identical data.ts.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Upgrade @types/node 18.15.11 -> 22\n\nVercel builds and runs on Node 22, so match the Node major in the type\ndefinitions instead of the long-outdated 18.15 pin (and not latest 26,\nwhich would type APIs we can''t use at runtime). No type errors result:\n`tsc --noEmit` and `tsc --noEmit -p cypress` both pass.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Håkon Harnes <hakon.harnes@effektiv-spenden.org>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9d6610ddd0473776d562fcf2a784e2f3aab1198b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stiftelsen-effekt/main-site/git/trees/9d6610ddd0473776d562fcf2a784e2f3aab1198b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stiftelsen-effekt/main-site/git/commits/0b7bd8dce346543f38abda1f93c41364a0271249","verification":{"payload":"tree 9d6610ddd0473776d562fcf2a784e2f3aab1198b\nparent e7740bc955a24f231a9598550ceba6a86264a1e4\nauthor Håkon Harnes <account@harnes.me> 1790942955 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790942955 +0200\n\nUpgrade dev tooling: Prettier 3, husky 9, lint-staged 16, dotenv-cli 11, @types/node 22 (#1172)\n\n* Bump dependencies within their current semver ranges\n\nRun `npm update --save` and `npm audit fix` in the root and studio.\nRoot advisories drop from 51 to 13 and studio from 46 to 12, clearing\nboth criticals (tar and decompress in the Sanity CLI). Everything left\nneeds a major bump.\n\n- Transpile next-sanity: 12.4 imports \"next/dynamic\" without an\n  extension, which fails when loaded as an external ESM module.\n- Keep @auth0/auth0-react on 2.10: 2.25+ types getAccessTokenSilently\n  as possibly undefined, which needs code changes (separate PR).\n- Pin the @types/react override to the direct dependency''s range.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Upgrade prettier 2.8.1 -> 3.9.9 without reformatting the codebase\n\nThe repo''s .prettierrc already sets trailingComma \"all\", arrowParens\n\"always\" and printWidth 100, so Prettier 3''s changed defaults do not\naffect us and no option pinning is needed. Prettier 3 also respects\n.gitignore by default, which only drops already-ignored files (e.g.\n.claude/) from the check.\n\nPrettier 3 does change some formatting algorithms that have no option\nto revert (nested ternary indentation, multi-value CSS `transition`\ndeclarations broken onto lines, single-line union types, parens around\n`??` inside ternaries, hugging of curried function arguments). 39\nexisting files would be reformatted by `prettier --write`. They are\nintentionally left untouched here to avoid conflicting with other open\nPRs; lint-staged will reformat them incrementally when touched, or a\none-off `npm run format` can be done once the parallel PRs have landed.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Upgrade husky 8 -> 9 and lint-staged 13 -> 16\n\nhusky 9: `prepare` is now just `husky` (`husky install` is deprecated),\nand hook files no longer need the shebang and `husky.sh` sourcing line.\nhusky now generates its own .husky/_ (with its own .gitignore), so the\nold .husky/.gitignore is removed.\n\nlint-staged 16 (Node >= 20.17) clears the npm audit advisories for\nlint-staged, micromatch and yaml pulled in by lint-staged 13. Our config\nis a plain glob -> \"prettier --write\" mapping and is unaffected by the\n14/15/16 breaking changes (Node versions, removed --shell flag, execa ->\nnano-spawn). lint-staged 17 requires Node >= 22.22.1, so we stay on 16.\n\nAfter pulling this, run `npm install` once so husky points\ncore.hooksPath at .husky/_.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Upgrade cross-env 7 -> 10, dotenv-cli 7 -> 11, dotenv 16 -> 17\n\ncross-env 10 is an ESM-only rewrite requiring Node >= 20; the CLI usage\nin our cypress scripts (`cross-env VAR=value cmd`) is unchanged.\n\ndotenv-cli 8-11 changed variable expansion (now dotenv-expand 12) and is\nquiet by default. Comparing the environment produced by\n`dotenv -e .env.sanity.build` and `dotenv -e .env.local` under 7.4.4 and\n11.0.0 gives identical values for every key from the env files; only\npre-existing shell variables that contain `$` are no longer re-expanded,\nwhich is the intended upstream change. `npm run prebuild` (Sanity Studio\nbuild) still succeeds.\n\ndotenv is held at 17 rather than 18: dotenv 18 ships its own `dotenv`\nbin (`dotenv run -f ...`), which collides with dotenv-cli''s `dotenv` bin\nin node_modules/.bin. With dotenv 18 installed, `dotenv -e file -- cmd`\nresolved to dotenv''s CLI and failed, breaking prebuild and the sanity\nscripts. Root dotenv is only needed as the peer dependency of\ncypress-dotenv, which uses the unchanged `config()` API.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Upgrade csv-parse 5 -> 7\n\nFixes the npm audit advisory for csv-parse < 7.0.2 (prototype\nreplacement reachable via `columns`). csv-parse is only used by the\nWealthCalculator data script (`npm run generate:wealthmountain`), which\nuses `parse` from `csv-parse/sync` with `columns: true`; that API is\nunchanged. Running the script before and after the upgrade produces a\nbyte-identical data.ts.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Upgrade @types/node 18.15.11 -> 22\n\nVercel builds and runs on Node 22, so match the Node major in the type\ndefinitions instead of the long-outdated 18.15 pin (and not latest 26,\nwhich would type APIs we can''t use at runtime). No type errors result:\n`tsc --noEmit` and `tsc --noEmit -p cypress` both pass.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Håkon Harnes <hakon.harnes@effektiv-spenden.org>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqv57rCRC1aQ7uu5