or":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/693641?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fellmirr/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fellmirr/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fellmirr/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fellmirr/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fellmirr","id":693641,"login":"fellmirr","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY5MzY0MQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fellmirr/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fellmirr/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fellmirr/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fellmirr/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fellmirr/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fellmirr","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stiftelsen-effekt/main-site/commits/15130c4e38cc300536e010203382de1d82ca4882/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-02T10:38:31Z","email":"account@harnes.me","name":"Håkon Harnes"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-02T10:38:31Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Stop sidebar citations from jumping after page load (#1166)\n\nThe default -1.5rem citation offset was only applied by JS after a fixed\n1000ms timeout, so citations rendered in one place and then jumped up a\nsecond later. Move the default offset into CSS so it is present on first\npaint, and run the overlap reflow on the next animation frame instead.\n\nAlso share a single ResizeObserver across all paragraph blocks (previously\none per block, never disconnected) and batch the reflow''s layout reads\nbefore its writes to avoid a forced layout per citation.\n\nCo-authored-by: Håkon Harnes <hakon.harnes@effektiv-spenden.org>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"14f8d93e8ec9b7fe331a80ccd15b90a199a7b3aa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stiftelsen-effekt/main-site/git/trees/14f8d93e8ec9b7fe331a80ccd15b90a199a7b3aa"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stiftelsen-effekt/main-site/git/commits/15130c4e38cc300536e010203382de1d82ca4882","verification":{"payload":"tree 14f8d93e8ec9b7fe331a80ccd15b90a199a7b3aa\nparent e5faf331132ed02e4acf06b6228cc21b38d83cf2\nauthor Håkon Harnes <account@harnes.me> 1790937511 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790937511 +0200\n\nStop sidebar citations from jumping after page load (#1166)\n\nThe default -1.5rem citation offset was only applied by JS after a fixed\n1000ms timeout, so citations rendered in one place and then jumped up a\nsecond later. Move the default offset into CSS so it is present on first\npaint, and run the overlap reflow on the next animation frame instead.\n\nAlso share a single ResizeObserver across all paragraph blocks (previously\none per block, never disconnected) and batch the reflow''s layout reads\nbefore its writes to avoid a forced layout per citation.\n\nCo-authored-by: Håkon Harnes <hakon.harnes@effektiv-spenden.org>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqv4mnCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA1mUQAJ7DCz0k33b5Fhx5JQlRST1B\nNkmWrDO30T3SWlcZTwLaX+eoYUN0EJesdFhiUucoqrZ6glJNH8QHH86GxkuffEcU\n/nDCmFOX6I3wlSrG+QD2OaBoe8JMRpJ7yqsCkWA8KIL6GfrbHfpLi48eY9Mx0yTN\n5c8WBFTAG9SuPHV2p90yJgUWNXtvYukhM8xX5U/UoWbC+1v0jV4XbdG9iq04/4B4\n6wUby4UPm48iKepj6ZQTtPeet8XpxmvMz7wdummqDg7RNmiXnk3lToZYYjKE4NGK\np0cvg38+NCRdsE4uB6CePAPDIHer8hVFY2+A29rQcdUKU/KCBB+Iajw+kFD7wZVC\nA/3JG/39G6mWO1DGtwQgyUM1X0G3mSIuKiq/FwTwxaj+00dhG4vl4ljkbARyQMf4\nalghca4+iRTZwhXFReaXqlZUsM7UCxiGVnJb2m78FNzXeYiPdghpXKvFXTd8c4ox\nk3J2RyBaz7RqW6Lfo6gadlvFPazDrbPQ+G1OKL1cxHX+JdrU+MRk8YqiP/gd9LYZ\nRuYEMuE5VMXZ3b7tXFlSPWoJb5Bx8xL3FfEaOo/9+6qFTFNH6k2i4fqGBU7qPxuf\nVSywn3ZcqZViWxqoqBIPrN8bpM9iyihj0AdsCw4Bn2YTJEyFPuCFxxj