}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fellmirr/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fellmirr","id":693641,"login":"fellmirr","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY5MzY0MQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fellmirr/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fellmirr/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fellmirr/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fellmirr/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fellmirr/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fellmirr","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stiftelsen-effekt/main-site/commits/e5faf331132ed02e4acf06b6228cc21b38d83cf2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-02T10:02:29Z","email":"account@harnes.me","name":"Håkon Harnes"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-02T10:02:29Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Nicer breaks of H1 on hero (#1106)\n\n* Nicer breaks of H1 on hero\n\n* Apply hero h1 hyphenation at all screen sizes\n\nThe rules were only in the 1181-1520px media query, so mobile (<=1180px)\nand large screens never got them.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Revert accidental package-lock.json change\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Håkon Harnes <hakon.harnes@effektiv-spenden.org>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0fb5f1e7eb7aef9e4ae8a2f1bf986c731659310d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stiftelsen-effekt/main-site/git/trees/0fb5f1e7eb7aef9e4ae8a2f1bf986c731659310d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stiftelsen-effekt/main-site/git/commits/e5faf331132ed02e4acf06b6228cc21b38d83cf2","verification":{"payload":"tree 0fb5f1e7eb7aef9e4ae8a2f1bf986c731659310d\nparent 8e800ee294f45e59e3a6955d09f04fdf0b03d39b\nauthor Håkon Harnes <account@harnes.me> 1790935349 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790935349 +0200\n\nNicer breaks of H1 on hero (#1106)\n\n* Nicer breaks of H1 on hero\n\n* Apply hero h1 hyphenation at all screen sizes\n\nThe rules were only in the 1181-1520px media query, so mobile (<=1180px)\nand large screens never got them.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Revert accidental package-lock.json change\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Håkon Harnes <hakon.harnes@effektiv-spenden.org>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqv4E1CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAju4QAKPhanzp34E+2k/rP6tAK0T3\nSw2vCnQg8qfCkYhEK4fM4Sm7goYJeVUT45iXUNNY47jZahEg8x2VDzxrIqMW13W6\n8A8MPnLC49AitrnPffInTwp9bHcJrp4kmx2fCAAdEF20QD6/3rWL7WpgqcI+Hozd\nMeG102Ow1LEcLF95RiogzGuUbe/FTbZcUWq5TulzuociUB2cheQSHdennbiL7Bhc\n5tibPeFGFKPxif1sDDbV1YqexBUGujgsBSrcNpcVXg8+S1HFoCJM0MYUeWQW5y2M\nG5xEWJnFz641XUMBTQXM0lY6kKhip4e8v9DiLiRs6oD+0gCQf/ng4+EM7WTMBHJB\n9zGvPE3+2TV+8GTwsCJz3cXmSfFE0yxMds1CFIYUDmfJxVddFUyr3mwpCz3INKF1\nmX0E9xmIGXcSEmjDK3BP0WUtEuxkiIpwHJ6UktMCoxqXXUTany34OLLjV/eivYvS\nkBQwW4WcXL540GRKDb4EjTMrfZ1XSXVJEGru146Q2AjNlPqSB4y7yKO+4VlqsZai\n5AswDwCJeS5YWzLlxSMIew5jKfrjpoeQ9qvEekswBs4zjOqTuY0Jw9hlggakVoq3\nyzZdjV8Z8imTW14JDWSXFR1VvBvUfMUzv1TJmplFmsn6saz1jyBqkLZoCReHm8TM\nnuhtPKGa2BI5Lai4KGdK\n=Oz8x\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-02T10:02:30Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/stiftelsen-effekt/main-site/commit/e5faf331132ed02e4acf06b6228cc21b38d83cf2","node_id":"C_kwDOGueVwtoAKGU1ZmFmMzMxMTMyZWQwMmU0YWNmMDZiNjIyOGNjMjFiMzhkODNjZjI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/stiftelsen-effekt/main-site/commit/8e800ee294f45e59e3a6955d09f04fdf0b03d39b","sha":"8e800ee294f45e59e3a6955d09f04fdf0b03d39b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stiftelsen-effekt/main-site/commits/8e800ee294f45e59e3a6955d09f04fdf0b03d39b"}],"sha":"e5faf331132ed02e4acf06b6228cc21b38d83cf2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stiftelsen-effekt/main-site/commits/e5faf331132ed02e4acf06b6228cc21b38d83cf2"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/693641?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fellmirr/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fellmirr/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fellmirr/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fellmirr/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fellmirr","id":693641,"login":"fellmirr","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY5MzY0MQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fellmirr/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fellmirr/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fellmirr/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fellmirr/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fellmirr/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fellmirr","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stiftelsen-effekt/main-site/commits/8e800ee294f45e59e3a6955d09f04fdf0b03d39b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-02T09:56:57Z","email":"account@harnes.me","name":"Håkon Harnes"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-02T09:56:57Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Serve widget cause area icons as small static files instead of inline base64 (#1164)\n\nThe six icons were inlined as ~350px base64 PNGs (~1.5 MB of source), which ended up in a 2.5 MB JS chunk that every page loads twice. They''re shown at 40x40px, so they''re now 120px greyscale PNGs (~45 KB total) in public/images/cause-areas.\n\nThe middleware rewrites every path it doesn''t skip to /<consent-state>/..., which 404s files in public/, so /images/ is added to the skip list.\n\nCo-authored-by: Håkon Harnes <hakon.harnes@effektiv-spenden.org>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"aee98aa76905a957b14d19cd23a414dfbaa9344a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stiftelsen-effekt/main-site/git/trees/aee98aa76905a957b14d19cd23a414dfbaa9344a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stiftelsen-effekt/main-site/git/commits/8e800ee294f45e59e3a6955d09f04fdf0b03d39b","verification":{"payload":"tree aee98aa76905a957b14d19cd23a414dfbaa9344a\nparent 4f84e8c64a6c7108dd04a59df7eefaac59a849b0\nauthor Håkon Harnes <account@harnes.me> 1790935017 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790935017 +0200\n\nServe widget cause area icons as small static files instead of inline base64 (#1164)\n\nThe six icons were inlined as ~350px base64 PNGs (~1.5 MB of source), which ended up in a 2.5 MB JS chunk that every page loads twice. They''re shown at 40x40px, so they''re now 120px greyscale PNGs (~45 KB total) in public/images/cause-areas.\n\nThe middleware rewrites every path it doesn''t skip to /<consent-state>/..., which 404s files in public/, so /images/ is added to the skip list.\n\nCo-authored-by: Håkon Harnes <hakon.harnes@effektiv-spenden.org>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqv3/pCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAidEQAH+4t6WacXqCV868yW8FRz3R\nhSrr4CnEcywft4vdQbeA/Cq/pFjHsAtrX5e1R7PHlezF0BWjrQiQVVRLtGyC3cLa\niyQPYQDJrB874UL7rk7lG+uXpVk9wdMtP8a2uLCudHCTwYppDfAOcfJLHH0ZQoeh\n4ZAMW6bb6LrST62FgQIjCv/O2ObLUb3YxjSiFX5HnqaufU3C3PLBcCyaxCOtLBSV\npn3nxC9FjymKl82fKCDDkZ65QMT2q5B+LPqVBDOLd7vmaGfllM6ozrXoXP51dpEq\nXe0nwNE8b5MBlUoLoLPrWmxf+W7/GFN3R4lpRnti6I8PJkIHSJf9ViqY1H9uV+Tm\nVFu689dwNM0TvdbrEctOso7jb6WiCTJV4JHQ7DoNvgyH9g3eyPF574QplexEVVBf\nipuFdB7so8otDW9ZbDCKQlHv572HfHlvDLWCNuz0hd52tH16E8U7zel/91NlhSyi\nOiVTNn9nRv5Zku8ZksMBsI6ufuXvtERF9mDmxouwt3DN+AGzTmWfN0tcNnyHRHNv\nJlvQBnvkISX/2zIRRB7rT4JyALo9nuAnFzQrS4rQJBXGNQfjUyexud4mpuiiT9TM\ndeAOu4GVVBwL0aq7kHSbtWFN0hPlzgejcx9xKvusVjokM/vKGwEuDsMTj+aevDIC\nlNLBDw8qkMr2U/xH42LY\n=BaHV\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-02T09:56:58Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"U