ssage":"Load the wealth calculator statically to avoid layout shift on client-side navigation (#1163)\n\nWith next/dynamic the calculator renders nothing until its chunk has loaded when navigating to the page client-side, so the page jumps from ~600px to ~1700px tall once it pops in. The chunk is ~11 KB gzipped (Observable Plot is already in the shared bundle), so including it statically is cheap.\n\nCo-authored-by: Håkon Harnes <hakon.harnes@effektiv-spenden.org>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"010d290d72c9c65877ec2fb9081643ed285fba71","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stiftelsen-effekt/main-site/git/trees/010d290d72c9c65877ec2fb9081643ed285fba71"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stiftelsen-effekt/main-site/git/commits/4f84e8c64a6c7108dd04a59df7eefaac59a849b0","verification":{"payload":"tree 010d290d72c9c65877ec2fb9081643ed285fba71\nparent fac938fb88e392bb154da03e95179bb5ba4cafa1\nauthor Håkon Harnes <account@harnes.me> 1790934533 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790934533 +0200\n\nLoad the wealth calculator statically to avoid layout shift on client-side navigation (#1163)\n\nWith next/dynamic the calculator renders nothing until its chunk has loaded when navigating to the page client-side, so the page jumps from ~600px to ~1700px tall once it pops in. The chunk is ~11 KB gzipped (Observable Plot is already in the shared bundle), so including it statically is cheap.\n\nCo-authored-by: Håkon Harnes <hakon.harnes@effektiv-spenden.org>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqv34FCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAwO4QAImDWr3e7ubY90jHSQjrwxbb\nMNArHx5atef73xQ+uM8W128hAsKpZt+LqcKyuid5212/y0mSw1vVi+uR5qhdaMr4\nQEc0qkpFwyRwlf8UGhFXWlaQIJxPv7Mxrpb/z+qA8YU/0O2XdFSxV/H/6waAzhIq\nP2CJ50/TzJmH9m5LKB9ejlb4wQoQVhOmvF8q8zaX3tiaMsyp1bjU6a/jdoidUC2m\nqLjlvysatn5W7RVIZVsGGmUVj18h5LMdtpxg6s2tzTinMtC2lMyYIMtrLz404rwz\nq8yd