ub.com/repos/stiftelsen-effekt/main-site/commits/4f84e8c64a6c7108dd04a59df7eefaac59a849b0"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/693641?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fellmirr/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fellmirr/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fellmirr/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fellmirr/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fellmirr","id":693641,"login":"fellmirr","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY5MzY0MQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fellmirr/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fellmirr/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fellmirr/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fellmirr/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fellmirr/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fellmirr","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stiftelsen-effekt/main-site/commits/fac938fb88e392bb154da03e95179bb5ba4cafa1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-02T09:40:39Z","email":"account@harnes.me","name":"Håkon Harnes"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-02T09:40:39Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Use 2026 tax calculators (Skatteetaten and Skatteverket) for the wealth calculator (#1162)\n\n* Use Skatteetaten''s 2026 tax calculator for the wealth calculator\n\nThe cache key already uses the current year, so 2026 entries were being filled with 2025 tax figures. The Norwegian tax cache entries should be purged after this is deployed.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Use Skatteverket''s 2026 tax table for the Swedish wealth calculator\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Håkon Harnes <hakon.harnes@effektiv-spenden.org>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f10edfd40efdd7a4f32a572019151ba232634291","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stiftelsen-effekt/main-site/git/trees/f10edfd40efdd7a4f32a572019151ba232634291"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stiftelsen-effekt/main-site/git/commits/fac938fb88e392bb154da03e95179bb5ba4cafa1","verification":{"payload":"tree f10edfd40efdd7a4f32a572019151ba232634291\nparent c6152e4de0a5638e45e68b6ec97030da61665eaa\nauthor Håkon Harnes <account@harnes.me> 1790934039 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790934039 +0200\n\nUse 2026 tax calculators (Skatteetaten and Skatteverket) for the wealth calculator (#1162)\n\n* Use Skatteetaten''s 2026 tax calculator for the wealth calculator\n\nThe cache key already uses the current year, so 2026 entries were being filled with 2025 tax figures. The Norwegian tax cache entries should be purged after this is deployed.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Use Skatteverket''s 2026 tax table for the Swedish wealth calculator\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Håkon Harnes <hakon.harnes@effektiv-spenden.org>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqv3wXCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAs4YQACPcKpqskv4C+f43qR4OJ1RR\n9IDzm5sH5BJZrDaT9+pUHIACmUwen9sKAycUD7POxhaUCk25Q8er6MkqVQOrSWdh\nLfjBnqbZyDa52Ba6D7dwb+xyK3/6xff08Iq+kIUe+HQVv/D852DQlxq3RAAch7O+\nY0Khmy151HjXN6q2ws2A0rTN7ywswIulH6sLhG9fuhzhXslz8AbvbRRAb8U4+9UA\nsBzNR7gdzaiVDbfznsfVbh9NRp4dKXW1c97PK+JlhDhL+cb4hpHPVogsoWCXGRn9\nJ0mpB5JSARmjk0meTpmkv2tgP9KVyk12rNu28J2itNbOluh5Ou+quQIumGVVPFi2\nRQabNe6TYKpYBOtDuV1vFz5mUSq+0x25iTwMQGbB4p2TNXFcgAFKjRSRNGZM5zoo\nXmtNceNzm4RNKi8W3lxyjlzHzT7gP2jvNDJgLWFLE2qqdFTngb58J/rIQVBOqsR9\n8dJGyTJI4QAm2AbJ9XXCVJ2gY4kd+kykECoYMASchyCtI7JKr6NqA2YEt/zwTXTz\nlDH1JWOU8