ithub.com/users/fellmirr/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fellmirr/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fellmirr/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fellmirr","id":693641,"login":"fellmirr","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY5MzY0MQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fellmirr/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fellmirr/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fellmirr/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fellmirr/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fellmirr/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fellmirr","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stiftelsen-effekt/main-site/commits/c6152e4de0a5638e45e68b6ec97030da61665eaa/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-02T09:26:49Z","email":"account@harnes.me","name":"Håkon Harnes"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-02T09:26:49Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Wealth calculator: refresh data, fix layout gap, move loading spinner (#1161)\n\n* Wealth calculator: refresh data, fix layout gap, move loading spinner\n\n- Refresh wealth mountain data from Gapminder''s povcalnet dataset (Nov 2025 update) and regenerate for 2026\n- Position the chart absolutely so it no longer holds the grid rows at their tallest height, which left a gap under the inputs after going 1 -> 2 -> 1 adults\n- Drop the removed adult''s income when reducing the number of adults\n- Put the adults selector above the children selector\n- Move the loading spinner to the top right of the chart, and skip it when no income is entered\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Show the wealth calculator loading spinner on the mobile calculate button\n\nOn mobile the chart is below the inputs, so the spinner in its corner is off-screen while\nediting. Show it next to the Beregn label instead, where people go to see the result.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Update the wealth calculator once per change and cache tax estimates\n\nChanging the number of adults moved the output twice: right away with the old post tax income,\nthen again when the new estimate arrived. Keep the estimate together with the number of adults\nit was made for, so the output only updates once the new estimate is ready.\n\nCache post tax income estimates client side, so toggling between inputs we''ve already estimated\nupdates instantly without the debounce, the spinner or a request. Stale responses are ignored.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Håkon Harnes <hakon.harnes@effektiv-spenden.org>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"50c2d76775ff56da81f3eadf74e8e27a9802a3f0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stiftelsen-effekt/main-site/git/trees/50c2d76775ff56da81f3eadf74e8e27a9802a3f0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stiftelsen-effekt/main-site/git/commits/c6152e4de0a5638e45e68b6ec97030da61665eaa","verification":{"payload":"tree 50c2d76775ff56da81f3eadf74e8e27a9802a3f0\nparent 0a8949efc524387e736bdde9cdf12c9482d5bd1f\nauthor Håkon Harnes <account@harnes.me> 1790933209 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790933209 +0200\n\nWealth calculator: refresh data, fix layout gap, move loading spinner (#1161)\n\n* Wealth calculator: refresh data, fix layout gap, move loading spinner\n\n- Refresh wealth mountain data from Gapminder''s povcalnet dataset (Nov 2025 update) and regenerate for 2026\n- Position the chart absolutely so it no longer holds the grid rows at their tallest height, which left a gap under the inputs after going 1 -> 2 -> 1 adults\n- Drop the removed adult''s income when reducing the number of adults\n- Put the adults selector above the children selector\n- Move the loading spinner to the top right of the chart, and skip it when no income is entered\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Show the wealth calculator loading spinner on the mobile calculate button\n\nOn mobile the chart is below the inputs, so the spinner in its corner is off-screen while\nediting. Show it next to the Beregn label instead, where people go to see the result.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Update the wealth calculator once per change and cache tax estimates\n\nChanging the number of adults moved the output twice: right away with the old post tax income,\nthen again when the new estimate arrived. Keep the estimate together with the number of adults\nit was made for, so the output only updates once the new estimate is ready.\n\nCache post tax income estimates client side, so toggling between inputs we''ve already estimated\nupdates instantly without the debounce, the spinner or a request. Stale responses are ignored.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Håkon Harnes <hakon.harnes@effektiv-spenden.org>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqv3jaCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAWI0QAFft+biCPsmuIpscDaZ5dLxS\nsCWPlzDfVqLgJz4++7APCUNTrAGVwQn8j4oZfBciZIF3c+gxQS2QgDIcjvtGO/vQ\n9WGJh8Xfa8RuloWxb/C1a6d0BymrEFpnb5oEVr+uzpOr6Wyndfk3iKZMDj7q5bBp\n+BOK0u57aG40kMVDJUXH4/48YMperIScTQgsMw1e/jOnobKcIqFn/WPI+FOG8+Kf\nFekAeU9hPNSrRFuTquJEYaDzU25wjAFBnuQ1zOiRhn6YBUWJo3dOmCExB2mmuwgy\ntD9ZKuNJ3blhJY11P0peWgrrZCppecgK8MLvEgXJQ/+3bvwIIB0rlazfm+3GRH0W\ncyTZd69JZRwRqhIkoCNmRybTNJeHPCaAUgVk+hFy0TRotx/dIzRd6e3qJOcjxShL\nCcVSN9QifQs9rTIthGPe3huZq5p1/oaQLvM7UEC4T1g6ha6b8DnDeZ0+tCLhp5wo\nMxsCyxu+nSm7A0Mrz9TZbpsWUlpadUB7viaW+iJvgIGSIdiCiIH4WmAncvpSmGAo\n7xS++4fM+k1aN2L6AwnBjCXGYRQ8SmcPNkf956ZS/oJrnf2UEJv16EcGuT7+Rgvq\nkQ