ut a track beside the bordered pane, and scrollbar-gutter ate into it. The homepage widget now grows with the page instead, so nothing paints over the box.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* Stop the carousel wrapper from becoming a scrollport.\n\noverflow-x: hidden was forcing overflow-y to auto, so opening Om smart fordeling put a scrollbar on the wrapper and the 576px pane ran into the track.\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Håkon Harnes <hakon.harnes@effektiv-spenden.org>\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>","tree":{"sha":"b225ec414254aa84f95eb1bde68cda97bd9a5c0b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stiftelsen-effekt/main-site/git/trees/b225ec414254aa84f95eb1bde68cda97bd9a5c0b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stiftelsen-effekt/main-site/git/commits/e0e47f5a5d6c2a08463847acacd5a7d894870408","verification":{"payload":"tree b225ec414254aa84f95eb1bde68cda97bd9a5c0b\nparent b28af4d1a4c59847183650e1f0938525bf9a6e2d\nauthor Håkon Harnes <account@harnes.me> 1788354716 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1788354716 +0200\n\nStop the widget scrollbar from clipping the right edge (#1151)\n\n* Keep widget pane content at 576px after reserving the scrollbar.\n\nscrollbar-gutter was taking space inside the fixed-width box and clipping the right edge, which shows up clearly on the inline Denmark widget.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* Keep the widget scrollbar outside the bordered DK card.\n\nThe previous width bump still put the track inside the rounded box. Scroll the unscaled wrapper instead, border the 576px pane, and leave a small gap so the thumb no longer sits on the card.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* Stop scrolling inside the inline DK widget card.\n\nThe wrapper max-height put a track beside the bordered pane, and scrollbar-gutter ate into it. The homepage widget now grows with the page instead, so nothing paints over the box.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* Stop the carousel wrapper from becoming a scrollport.\n\noverflow-x: hidden was forcing overflow-y to auto, so opening Om smart fordeling put a scrollbar on the wrapper and the 576px pane ran into the track.\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Håkon Harnes <hakon.harnes@effektiv-spenden.org>\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqmCCcCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAV0QQAKAWPhAYcvUxX1k95ucnC2Qy\nljSBqXhZp+tlJHU4T7d7PkGpyyQUc4IA8/Jy05v9+eQ8mLJkzaVk9u+val7mmxQW\n/kKNyVcQZu38rc2ABMm/H5N8Vc0SVyvG2U9EgDTi6/XzY3ldQQz4o8vBIF7EpiA9\n8a2fK7BDo6NMLwfhDpt15c4YFer8btnaLpQEdyyas2pBa/fbzcrp4Oy7d6Idjq0u\nsN+745L5G6pizyv2QO/WLOxgEfh8XGq3ijamtiqVJIWgN2geb8ZT/mjPPBE55fxL\nSMH2BKTZYMVfIx5b9wP2dFmNQaKj2UULg8CLKuf++bkCrz8N5FLGG5PwN17dYz0n\nfigWvtWM8jTKQV6vyl9o7D5k09R47MfKiMXxqMbgL7DJ1g5AsJCrN4AKysamg9bi\nIKE5PWEFH4O+hCGEfE5EasdWaWYRBFJBpvmH1lI5dSp/SMm4A8/RiWVFcaeINwf2\nry0oIHy5xfStdldXxx1WoserPMYfr4LAuPNhw/DHJoKp4rSdCVreN0cUHRx62nAu\nhy/TGqYhBFo4+EWgKtIMjhUlAhJuIIfouOi3n1xeWzVm5XNWdG8rfmnhdZ9dnRwK\nief7Jc0+ngLd4qkHStksF744UJF7djOASUiJJ7SNmdisKhTGZjV0q3Wpxx1pznKV\ntQVQ8BcgCfbrH/59Ro2n\n=VQI+\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-02T13:11:59Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"http