d distribution arrives with custom already selected on the donor''s\nbehalf, so the cause area sum - and its suggested amounts - is still their\namount entry, and the prefilled shares track a split of it. Editing one of\nthose amounts freezes that tracking and makes the organization amounts the\ntotal, leaving the sum as a stale field that silently ignores further input -\nso hide it from that point on, as when the donor picks custom themselves.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a5590aa4e655e963a9403a8c003900ae70ea2369","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stiftelsen-effekt/main-site/git/trees/a5590aa4e655e963a9403a8c003900ae70ea2369"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stiftelsen-effekt/main-site/git/commits/ed870b0d7b9c97e3db044593b544f6e63a2d3405","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/stiftelsen-effekt/main-site/commit/ed870b0d7b9c97e3db044593b544f6e63a2d3405","node_id":"C_kwDOGueVwtoAKGVkODcwYjBkN2I5Yzk3ZTNkYjA0NDU5M2I1NDRmNmU2M2EyZDM0MDU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/stiftelsen-effekt/main-site/commit/d564e528308205c5f101b79677accc8724469b1c","sha":"d564e528308205c5f101b79677accc8724469b1c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stiftelsen-effekt/main-site/commits/d564e528308205c5f101b79677accc8724469b1c"}],"sha":"ed870b0d7b9c97e3db044593b544f6e63a2d3405","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stiftelsen-effekt/main-site/commits/ed870b0d7b9c97e3db044593b544f6e63a2d3405"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/112557835?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EliseAndresen/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EliseAndresen/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EliseAndresen/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EliseAndresen/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://githu